ex="-1"><div class="_2z3uq _9aeo0"><div class="W3C1B" data-hook="divider divider-single" role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" style="height:29px"><div class="nvef-"><svg class="p7vC3 z3zCi LviFc v-pSx" height="2"><line x1="0" x2="100%" y1="1" y2="1" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt"></line></svg><div class="_1hY0C"> </div></div></div></div></div></div><div type="divider" data-hook="rcv-block69"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-lb5lk22519" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block70"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-r5qhl20144" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Vous vous reconnaissez dans ce que vous venez de lire ? </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block71"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-3amn620338" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Je vous accompagne en Gestalt-thérapie à Tours (cabinet) ou en visio.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block72"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-x17nm20241" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Séance : 45 minutes - 70 € • Annulation : 24h à l’avance</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block73"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-lb3nf22521" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block74"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-3umsr20827" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Prendre rendez-vous </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block75"></div><div data-breakout="normal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="au